      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 54478e32170eec20a62a2a8d8527c92bdb01bafa\nparent 4519933391dd23dbf1a4eceec6dd53d2e9e71cc3\nauthor nervana21 <205626986+nervana21@users.noreply.github.com> 1788399301 -0500\ncommitter nervana21 <205626986+nervana21@users.noreply.github.com> 1788731396 -0500\n\nrpc: Stamp `getblock` OpenRPC result discriminator\n\nOpenRPC documents `getblock` as a four-way `oneOf` on `verbosity`, but\nnothing in the schema maps `verbosity` values onto those branches.\n\nAdd optional `RPCResultDiscriminator` on `RPCResults`, emit it as\n`x-bitcoin-discriminatedResult`, and stamp `getblock` so `verbosity`\nselects the existing oneOf arms via {0, 1, 2, 3} in that order.\n\nNo runtime behavior change.\n",
